":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":1141,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["angular","javascript","pwa","typescript","web","web-framework","web-performance"],"visibility":"public","forks":27110,"open_issues":1141,"watchers":100153,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/pulls/30675","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/pull/30675","diff_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/pull/30675.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/pull/30675.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"**fix(ivy): type checking - apply attribute to property name mapping**\r\nSome HTML attributes don't correspond to their DOM property name, in which\r\ncase the runtime will apply the appropriate transformation when assigning\r\na property using its attribute name. One example of this is the `for`\r\nattribute, for which the DOM property is named `htmlFor`.\r\n\r\nThe type-checking machinery in ngtsc must also take this mapping into\r\naccount, as it generates type-check code in which unclaimed property bindings\r\nare assigned to properties of (subtypes of) `HTMLElement`.\r\n\r\nFixes #30607\r\nFixes FW-1327\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n**fix(ivy): type checking - handle $implicit ng-template variables**\r\nWhen an `ng-template` element has a variable declaration without a value,\r\nit is assigned the value of the `$implicit` property in the embedded view's\r\ncontext. The template compiler inserts a property access to `$implicit` for\r\ntemplate variables without a value, however the type-check code generation\r\nlogic did not. This resulted in incorrect type-checking code being generated.\r\n\r\nFixes FW-1326","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/30675/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/30675/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":2373281051,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDIzNzMyODEwNTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/events/2373281051","actor":{"login":"AndrewKushnir","id":43554145,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTU0MTQ1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43554145?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrewKushnir","html_url":"https://github.com/AndrewKushnir","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrewKushnir/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrewKushnir/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrewKushnir/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrewKushnir/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrewKushnir/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrewKushnir/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrewKushnir/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrewKushnir/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AndrewKushnir/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2019-05-28T22:12:38Z","label":{"name":"comp: ivy","color":"c5def5"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":2373281075,"node_id":"MDE1Ok1pbGVzdG9uZWRFdmVudDIzNzMyODEwNzU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/events/2373281075","actor":{"login":"ngbot[bot]","id":33250855,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90MzMyNTA4NTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/6359?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https